<SimpleLayout title="About Vice City Support" description="Who runs Vice City Support, how we verify GTA 6 collectible locations, and why nothing on this site is guessed.">
  <p>Vice City Support is an independent, fan-made guide site for <strong>Grand Theft Auto VI</strong>. We focus on one thing: getting you to every collectible as fast as possible, with clear answers you can read on your phone while you play.</p>
  <h2>How we verify</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>No guesses, no leaks.</strong> Before launch we only publish facts Rockstar has officially confirmed.</li>
    <li><strong>Checked in-game.</strong> Collectible names, counts and locations go live only after we've confirmed them ourselves.</li>
    <li><strong>Dated.</strong> Every answer page shows an "Updated" date so you know how fresh it is.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Your checklists stay on your device</h2>
  <p>The tick-boxes on our checklists are saved in your browser's local storage. We never see them, and they're not tied to any account.</p>
  <h2>Spotted a mistake?</h2>
  <p>Tell us via the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>. Corrections are fixed fast and credited if you like.</p>
  <p>Vice City Support is not affiliated with Rockstar Games or Take-Two Interactive. See our <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</p>
</SimpleLayout>
